{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19927","headline":"与二三友秋宵会话清上人院 二 · 孟郊","name":"与二三友秋宵会话清上人院 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"好鸟无杂栖，华堂有嘉携。\n琴樽互倾奏，歌赋相和谐。\n但嘉鱼水合，莫令云雨乖。\n一爲鵾鸡弹，再鼓壮士怀。\n初景待谁晓，新春逐君来。\n愿言良友会，高驾不知回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19927.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19927","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}